<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept importance="optional" id="t00135">
	<title>Integrated memory system</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>adjusting
					<indexterm>integrated memory system</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>Integrated memory system for the driver’s seat is provided to store and recall the following memory settings with a simple button operation.</p>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00666">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00667">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="images/N_SP3i26_B05_015_1_E.jpg" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<ul id="e00668">
			<li>
				<p>Driver’s seat position</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Outside rearview mirror</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Head up display (HUD)</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<note type="warning" id="e00669">
			<p>Never attempt to operate the integrated memory system while the vehicle is moving.</p>
			<p>This could result in loss of control, and an accident causing death, serious injury, or property damage.</p>
		</note>
		<note type="note" id="e00670">
			<ul id="e00671">
				<li>
					<p>Even if the battery is disconnected, the memory setting will be retained.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>If integrated memory system does not operate normally, have the system inspected by a professional workshop. Kia recommends visiting an authorized Kia dealer or service partner.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</note>
	</conbody>
